        "text": {
            "description_html": "<P><b>Fusion 34-B7, Scroll Egg Knob with Oval Beaded Rose Rose</b></P>\r\n<p>The scroll design of Fusion Hardware's solid brass knob adds just enough detail to elevate it from the mundanely simplistic to something both sophisticated and elegant. The Ribbon and Reed rose adds beauty while maintaing the old world feel that grants this knobset its character. Available in Oil Rubbed Bronze, Brushed Nickel, Antique Pewter, and Lifetime Polished Brass finishes. It will fit 1-1/4\" to 2\" thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Fusion 34-B7 Scroll Knob and Oval Beaded Rose Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<LI>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</LI>\r\n<li>Concealed screw assembly for sleek appearance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<P><B>Specifications</B> for Ornate Door Knob Fusion 34 B7:\r\n<UL>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<LI>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</LI>\r\n<LI>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</LI>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><B>When Selecting a Function:</B><ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Dummy Set: Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul></p>",
